{"v":4,"catch":"堅強起來，把他們擊倒！","desc":"《CHAMPION WRESTLER》是TAITO於1989年發行的動作遊戲。\n成為一名職業摔跤手，在成為冠軍的路上一舉成名！\n從 8 個可用的摔跤手中選擇一個，並利用他們自己獨特的統計數據和特殊技能來取勝！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-09-08","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/faff9144227a1a6772c04af783f7dbb6888a01c9b0b91823dbac4ef44bcb2ee8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d9ccbbecbdf7ce3b1d87b541086dd2fb77151350b7aad49f98795f843b5d1ad7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/044e5ee032dc8e2e46ee3924e1ccfe9afc79935e23a0ab4ae20441c4bf4a5122.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b2730f327c1302dac5d41379141209c597e1635eecedd11716432f2d2cba9f5e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/65946adf42e231f205c9f4cd7bca917c7e7f18b7590679aafaa9b791cc094902.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8d3e654767c05ebb3ff7d1e342691e100e5a64fa33b09dd3bb247d47908d9f9d.jpg"],"titleId":"01005fd018dce000","dlc":[]}